      "index": 0,
      "en": " — FS Poll handle",
      "ja": " — FS Pollハンドル"
    },
    {
      "index": 1,
      "en": "FS Poll handles allow the user to monitor a given path for changes. Unlike\n",
      "ja": "FS Pollハンドルは、指定したパスの変更を監視できます。"
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
